    "detailed_description": "<h1>Buzz</h1><p>We want your feedback on Gassy Man! What do you like? What doi you love? What do you hate? Do you want to see Gassy Man developed into a full-length game? Updates and announcements will be posted here!</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1357150/extras/steammaincapgassy.png?t=1595267800\" /></div><br>The free-to-play version of Gassy Man, a game in development from All Day Breakfast Productions. <br>In Gassy Man our hero (Mike), must use his strangely noxious super power to defend the Earth from alien invaders!<br>Use the power of your own gas to fly across the city and knock UFOs out of the sky to save humanity from extraterrestrial invasion forces.<br>This game is in Beta and we would love to get player feedback to help make it better.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1357150/extras/aa2adbf3ddddb235519355ec8a6ab60e.avif?t=1595267800\" /></div><br>Simple gameplay mechanics utilize the directional arrows. Up to fly, left and right to move or float in that direction.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1357150/extras/112081384866e51b899e260d6fbdd49f.avif?t=1595267800\" /></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1357150/extras/steammaincapgassy.png?t=1595267800\" /></div><br>The free-to-play version of Gassy Man, a game in development from All Day Breakfast Productions. <br>In Gassy Man our hero (Mike), must use his strangely noxious super power to defend the Earth from alien invaders!<br>Use the power of your own gas to fly across the city and knock UFOs out of the sky to save humanity from extraterrestrial invasion forces.<br>This game is in Beta and we would love to get player feedback to help make it better.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1357150/extras/aa2adbf3ddddb235519355ec8a6ab60e.avif?t=1595267800\" /></div><br>Simple gameplay mechanics utilize the directional arrows. Up to fly, left and right to move or float in that direction.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1357150/extras/112081384866e51b899e260d6fbdd49f.avif?t=1595267800\" /></div>",
